<% else %>Hi <%= @participant.name %>,

<% case @kind %><% when "not_started" %>A quick reminder: your conversation with Mjadi about <%= @company_name %> is waiting. It takes about fifteen to twenty minutes, and you can type or send voice notes.
<% when "not_started_again" %>Your conversation with Mjadi about <%= @company_name %> is still waiting. It only takes about fifteen minutes, and you can pause whenever you need.
<% when "paused" %>Pick up where you left off whenever suits you. Everything you said is saved.
<% else %>Thanks again for your time. If you can, these documents you mentioned would help:
<% @documents.each do |d| %>- <%= d %>
<% end %>It's optional.
